1137
01:07:02,192 --> 01:07:03,802
The Governor of Washington

1138
01:07:03,845 --> 01:07:04,977
declaring
a state of emergency.

1139
01:07:06,979 --> 01:07:08,589
Tens of millions
of us work from home

1140
01:07:08,633 --> 01:07:10,504
while offices
sit largely empty

1141
01:07:10,548 --> 01:07:12,115
from California
to Connecticut...

1142
01:07:21,080 --> 01:07:22,560
I've got this thing

1143
01:07:22,603 --> 01:07:24,170
that says "an installer"

1144
01:07:24,214 --> 01:07:25,954
and it says,
"Do you want to move

1145
01:07:25,998 --> 01:07:29,132
the Zoom installer
to the trash?"

