Okay.
Can you hear me okay now?

1154
01:07:50,414 --> 01:07:52,068
Yeah, I don't know
what's going on with the mic.

1155
01:07:52,111 --> 01:07:53,895
For some reason
it didn't, uh

1156
01:07:53,939 --> 01:07:55,680
I couldn't hear you
and you couldn't hear me.

1157
01:07:55,723 --> 01:07:57,899
- Sorry.
- No, that's fine.

1158
01:07:58,378 --> 01:08:01,425
Minky!
My wife is coming for the cat.

1159
01:08:01,468 --> 01:08:03,166
Basically,
I had about a day notice.

1160
01:08:03,209 --> 01:08:06,299
So, I grabbed my laptop
on the night of March 16th

1161
01:08:06,343 --> 01:08:08,127
and headed home

1162
