1163
01:08:10,434 --> 01:08:13,480
So, it was like,
boom, the hammer came down.

1164
01:08:16,092 --> 01:08:19,398
We had this anomaly
January 25th,

1165
01:08:19,443 --> 01:08:21,487
the antenna
was actually supposed to go down

1166
01:08:21,532 --> 01:08:22,663
February 5th.

1167
01:08:23,664 --> 01:08:25,666
NASA got involved and said,

1168
01:08:25,710 --> 01:08:27,711
"You need to demonstrate

1169
01:08:27,755 --> 01:08:30,496
that Voyager 2
is ready for this downtime

1170
01:08:30,541 --> 01:08:32,934
or we won't allow
the antenna to go down."

1171
01:08:36,199 --> 01:08:39,027
Everybody agreed that
the Voyager spacecraft was safe

1172
01:08:39,071 --> 01:08:42,074
and it was the right thing to do
