It'll take many months
and a few nervous moments.

1177
01:09:15,412 --> 01:09:18,154
They started it
March 9th and, uh,

1178
01:09:18,197 --> 01:09:21,374
we all went into COVID,
you know, a week later.

1179
01:09:27,511 --> 01:09:31,514
It is it
daunting and scary.

1180
01:09:31,993 --> 01:09:34,952
People people are wondering
when it's all gonna end.

1181
01:09:35,910 --> 01:09:37,260
Not a very happy environment.

1182
