01:10:18,518 --> 01:10:19,998
and you have to do
every them

1193
01:10:20,041 --> 01:10:21,608
each
every one of them correctly,

1194
01:10:21,652 --> 01:10:23,088
and if you can figure out
all the things

1195
01:10:23,130 --> 01:10:24,785
that you need to do

1196
