That is the plan.
But, uh, who knows?

1206
01:10:53,031 --> 01:10:55,816
I mean, you're talking about
mid-'70s technology.

1207
01:10:56,295 --> 01:10:58,210
The future is not certain.

1208
01:10:58,862 --> 01:11:05,130
♪

1209
