I'm the only one here
team-wise.

1210
01:11:30,286 --> 01:11:32,026
The rest of the people
that are here right now

1211
01:11:32,070 --> 01:11:33,201
are our movers.

1212
01:11:35,726 --> 01:11:38,728
I'll show you what the
conference room looks like.

1213
01:11:38,772 --> 01:11:41,340
Because we've got
essential products

1214
01:11:41,384 --> 01:11:43,037
and boxes all packed up
in there,

1215
01:11:43,081 --> 01:11:44,778
there's nothing
