1216
01:11:44,822 --> 01:11:47,346
Remember all our awards?

1217
01:11:47,389 --> 01:11:49,870
Big trash bins everywhere.

1218
01:11:58,879 --> 01:12:01,491
I thought
that we were very well-prepared

1219
01:12:01,534 --> 01:12:04,407
for the downtime.

1220
01:12:04,450 --> 01:12:06,757
But we had to tweak things

1221
01:12:06,800 --> 01:12:09,020
more than we would have

1222
01:12:09,063 --> 01:12:11,109
since we were moving
the facilities.

1223
01:12:16,941 --> 01:12:18,334
NASA made the room for us

1224
01:12:18,377 --> 01:12:20,031
to go back
over to the laboratory.

1225
01:12:21,772 --> 01:12:25,471
We had a lot of things to move,
a lot of things to pack.

1226
01:12:25,514 --> 01:12:28,344
We've been there for like,
uh, gosh, close to 20 years.

1227
01:12:30,955 --> 01:12:32,826
It's more
than just taking your plant

1228
01:12:32,870 --> 01:12:34,741
from one office
