1235
01:12:51,410 --> 01:12:55,414
and the whole command system
that Voyager uses

1236
01:12:55,458 --> 01:12:58,591
was offline and damaged,

1237
01:12:58,635 --> 01:13:01,246
and it's a bit of
the low-tech things

1238
01:13:01,289 --> 01:13:03,030
that, uh, can kill a mission.

1239
01:13:04,989 --> 01:13:06,251
We struggle, you know?

1240
01:13:06,817 --> 01:13:09,950
Different environment,
version machines,

1241
01:13:10,690 --> 01:13:14,041
but in all the adjustments,
the new computers,

1242
01:13:14,085 --> 01:13:17,915
the new ways of doing things,
that keeps me going.

1243
01:13:20,004 --> 01:13:21,092
As you know...

1244
01:13:22,309 --> 01:13:24,225
tragedy in the family
happened and...

1245
01:13:25,313 --> 01:13:28,404
right in the middle
of, uh, the pandemic.

1246
01:13:33,931 --> 01:13:35,411
She always had issues

1247
01:13:35,454 --> 01:13:38,501
with high blood pressure.

1248
01:13:38,544 --> 01:13:42,243
When I got home around 6:00,
I asked my son,

1249
