"Where's your mom?"

1250
01:13:44,507 --> 01:13:47,466
He says, "Well, sh
she should be at the office."

1251
01:13:47,510 --> 01:13:49,380
So, I called her office,
nothing.

1252
01:13:49,425 --> 01:13:53,298
I asked my son,
"Can you go check on her?"

1253
01:13:53,341 --> 01:13:55,735
And he went
and checked on her

1254
01:13:55,779 --> 01:13:58,825
