on the floor.

1255
01:13:58,869 --> 01:14:02,612
She had
some kind of aneurysm.

1256
01:14:02,655 --> 01:14:05,092
It was not possible
to operate.

1257
01:14:06,050 --> 01:14:07,573
But, uh,

1258
01:14:07,617 --> 01:14:11,098
we kept fighting
for 17 days and...

1259
01:14:11,142 --> 01:14:13,449
and that's when she passed away,
on February 2nd.

1260
01:14:16,843 --> 01:14:19,019
50-plus years together...

1261
01:14:20,412 --> 01:14:21,457
uh...

1262
01:14:22,545 --> 01:14:23,589
yeah.

1263
01:14:28,986 --> 01:14:32,684
I lost a lot of weight,
about 17 pounds.

1264
01:14:33,251 --> 01:14:36,384
But, uh,
work keeps me busy.

1265
01:14:36,428 --> 01:14:37,473
Uh...

1266
01:14:39,562 --> 01:14:40,780
I always love Voyager.

1267
01:14:45,785 --> 01:14:49,049
It makes me feel
that I'm needed someplace.

1268
01:14:50,660 --> 01:14:54,490
That I have the expertise
to take Voyager,

1269
01:14:54,532 --> 01:14:56,840
uh, past 2025.

1270
01:14:58,102 --> 01:14:59,277
